    {
      "content": "\nAppointed designers or contractors is solely a Tenant nomination. However, Arado reserves the right to reject a contractor on the bad historical performance. The appointment of any Tenant consultant and contractor remains tenants' responsibility at all times with no liabilities to Arado.",
